<section class="section section--pad" aria-labelledby="snow-removal-scope-heading">
  <div class="panel panel--soft">
    <div class="trg-editable" data-trg-editable>
      <div class="trg-editable__fallback">
        <h2 id="snow-removal-scope-heading" class="heading-lg">Define the Scope for Your Site</h2>
        <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">01</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Operating Areas</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Identify the locations involved and the areas that matter most to your operation. Describe the site layout, access considerations and priorities that should guide the discussion.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">02</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Equipment &amp; Resources</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Outline the snow-removal vehicles and equipment currently available, along with the personnel involved. Highlight equipment concerns or resource gaps that may affect the scope of support.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">03</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Operational Priorities</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Explain the challenges you want to address and the timing of your requirements. These details help establish what support is needed and which related services may be relevant.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trg-editable__cms">
        <squarespace:block-field id="snowRemovalServicesScope" columns="12" label="EDIT: Define the Scope for Your Site" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

